[Applause]  [Music]  kelly clarkson honors dolly parton with  a touching performance  [Music]  [Music]  singing one of dolly's most iconic songs  the voice judge gave everyone chills  during the 2022 acm awards  [Music]  dolly who hosted the big night came out  on stage to give kelly her flowers for  the sweet  tribute that is so great  i was backstage trying not to cry my  false eyelashes off and  slinging snot every direction and tears  the prolific songwriter takes a moment  to shout out whitney houston who made  the song famous with her cover for the  bodyguard  i know that  whitney is smiling down on us tonight so  thank you very much  should be proud of that dolly gushed  over kelly to e.t leading up to the big  night i know you have a special  friendship with kelly so what does how  does that make you feel knowing she's  going to be doing that for you well it  makes me feel great that she's going to  be doing it because kelly is one of the  greatest singers in the world it's one  thing for people to do a tribute you  know it's going to be pretty good you  know but with her you know it's going to  be real good so i do love her to death i  love her personality i just love the way  she is and i have known her for a long  time but we don't get to hang out or  anything and i just found out just a few  days ago that she was actually going to  be doing a tribute to me so that that's  going to be special for me of course  and kelly chose the perfect track to  honor dolly's legacy it's hard to ever  know  exactly what makes a hit a hit i'm very  very proud i will always love you dolly  opened up to et about what the song's  enduring success means to her i was  proud of it when i wrote it i had a very  deep personal feeling towards the song  that was 20 some years ago and i wrote  it from a very emotional  place in myself and in my life at that  time i think it fits people that have  been partners maybe people that have  divorced people that have been lovers  children 